#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:1 messages/po4a/en.xml:512
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mobile app (Android)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "移动端 APP（Android）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "> Capacitor 壳 + 统一 shell-ui SPA（聊天室 / 管理台 / 设置）。  \n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "> 实现包：[`app/mobile/`](../../app/mobile/)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "范围"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 项       | 说明                                                        |\n"
"| -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 平台     | **仅 Android** sideload（APK）；iOS 后续                    |\n"
"| 模块     | 聊天室 chat（`sap-direct`）+ 管理台 admin（`hub-rest`）     |\n"
"| Hub 配置 | APP **Hub 设置**：地址 + `remote_auth.token`（Preferences） |\n"
"| Hub 职责 | `/api` REST + `/sap/v1` WebSocket                           |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "拓扑"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flowchart LR\n"
"  Phone[Android WebView]\n"
"  Shell[shell-ui SPA]\n"
"  Chat[\"/chat\"]\n"
"  Admin[\"/admin\"]\n"
"  Settings[\"/settings\"]\n"
"  Hub[Anima Service]\n"
"\n"
"  Phone --> Shell\n"
"  Shell --> Chat\n"
"  Shell --> Admin\n"
"  Shell --> Settings\n"
"  Chat -->|SAP auth_token| Hub\n"
"  Admin -->|REST Bearer| Hub\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:39
msgid ""
"移动端 REST **直连** Hub（无桌面 Electron 的 `/api` 本地代理）；须配置 "
"`remote_auth.token` 且 Hub 允许 Capacitor Origin（`http://localhost`）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub 设置"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:48
msgid ""
"家里 PC：`anima service start --host 0.0.0.0`，并在 `~/.anima/config.yaml` 配"
"置 `remote_auth.token`（见 [`remote-access.md`](../guide/remote-"
"access.md)）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:48
msgid "（可选）`anima tunnel setup`，手机使用 `https://<your-hostname>`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:48
msgid "APP → **Hub 设置**（`/settings`）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:48
msgid "Hub 地址（Tunnel 域名或 `http://<PC-IP>:2658`；勿用 `127.0.0.1`）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:48
msgid ""
"远程 Token（与 Hub `config.yaml` 中 `remote_auth.token` 相同，≥16 字符）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:48
msgid "**测试连接** → **保存并进入** → 顶栏切换 **聊天室** / **管理台**。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:50
msgid ""
"非 loopback Hub 地址必须填写 token；REST 使用 `Authorization: Bearer`，SAP "
"在 `connect` 帧携带 `auth_token`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "排障"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 现象 | 常见原因 |\n"
"| ---- | -------- |\n"
"| 聊天输入无反应 | 无选中会话（首装应自动建会话）；或 SAP 未连接 |\n"
"| 管理台 load failed / Failed to fetch | Hub 未 `--host 0.0.0.0`、Token 错误、防火墙；Chrome Remote Debugging 看请求是否带 Bearer |\n"
"| Not Found | 勿访问旧路径如 `/admin/dashboard/index.html`；应走 SPA `/admin/dashboard` |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "构建与 sideload"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:61
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"bun run app/mobile:build\n"
"cd app/mobile && bun run sync\n"
"cd android && ./gradlew assembleDebug\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:68
msgid "包内 README：[`app/mobile/README.md`](../../app/mobile/README.md)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "与桌面壳对比"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:77
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|             | Electron `app/desktop`                  | Capacitor `app/mobile` |\n"
"| ----------- | --------------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n"
"| 注入        | preload → `window.satelliteShell`       | `shell-bridge.js` → 同形 API |\n"
"| Hub 配置    | Hub 设置 → `~/.anima/shell-client.json` | Hub 设置 → Preferences |\n"
"| REST        | 本地静态服代理 `/api`（同源）           | 直连 `hubUrl/api/*`（CORS + Bearer） |\n"
"| instance_id | 文件 `~/.anima/satellites/chat/`        | Preferences            |\n"
"| 内容        | chat + admin + companion                | chat + admin           |\n"
msgstr ""
